DEFINITION  Homo sapiens ATP synthase F1 subunit alpha (ATP5F1A), RefSeqGene on
            chromosome 18; nuclear gene for mitochondrial product.
ACCESSION   NG_041769
VERSION     NG_041769.2
KEYWORDS    RefSeq; RefSeqGene.
SOURCE      Homo sapiens (human)
  ORGANISM  Homo sapiens
            Eukaryota; Metazoa; Chordata; Craniata; Vertebrata; Euteleostomi;
